"warranty, up to 60% cheaper than new. Good for your budget, better for the "
"planet.</span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"o_animated_text o_animate o_anim_fade_in o_visible "
"o_anim_from_left\" style=\"--wanim-intensity: 5; animation-duration: 0.6s;\">"
