#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:electronic_refurbishment.product_template_10
msgid "Ear Cushions"
msgstr "Coussinets d'oreille"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:electronic_refurbishment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Easily add replacement parts (like fresh screens or batteries) to the order, "
"which automatically updates the final inventory cost of the refurbished "
"device."
msgstr ""
"Ajoutez facilement des pièces de rechange (comme des écrans ou des batteries "
"neufs) à l'ordre, ce qui met automatiquement à jour le coût final en stock "
"de l'appareil reconditionné."

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:electronic_refurbishment.product_template_10
msgid "Eco-Engineered Reliability"
msgstr "Fiabilité écoresponsable"

#. module: electronic_refurbishment
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:electronic_refurbishment.product_template_4
